        NavigationBar_NavButton__JwONn primary" data-testid="blox-button"><div class="Button_ButtonContent__qPyqO Button_ButtonContent-md__1XTQo"><div class="undefined Button_Text-md__R7FDU Button_BtnText__nrjra  primary " data-testid="text-custom">BOOK PROPERTY</div></div></div></div></div><div class="PropertyDetails_RelativeComponentCtn__xJB6K"><div class="PropertyDetails_BodyWrapper__xzEAL"><div class="PropertyDetails_leftSection__nwaCM"><section id="Overview"><div class="Overview_OverviewMain__jK_BF"><div class="Overview_Overview__Bc1p3 false" data-testid="blox-Overview"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm undefined Overview_HeadingTextOverview__4Xh33"><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Overview</div></h2><div class="Overview_OverviewData__cLXua"><div class="TruncatedText_TruncateText__iKHoI text-12 
            undefined
            undefined"><div class="undefined TruncatedText TruncatedText_line-4__CGy8m Overview_OverviewDescriptionTruncText__KLEw7 
                 " data-testid="text-custom">Oberoi Three Sixty West is a prestigious luxury residential project located in Worli, Mumbai, developed by the renowned Oberoi Realty. This iconic mixed-use development features ultra-spacious 4 &amp; 5 BHK sea-facing homes, offering an unmatched blend of sophistication &amp; comfort. One of the two towers houses the globally acclaimed Ritz-Carlton Hotel, while the other is home to premium residences managed by The Ritz-Carlton, ensuring the highest standards in hospitality &amp; lifestyle. Designed for elite living, each residence is positioned to provide panoramic Arabian Sea views, along with maximum privacy &amp; exclusivity, making it a landmark for luxury living in South Mumbai.</div></div></div><div class="Overview_OverviewGrid__OKQXI false"><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Configuration</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">4 BHK, 5 BHK</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Ready to move</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Completed in Jun 2022</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Avg. Price</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">₹85,960/sq.ft</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">RERA Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">5235 - 6651 sqft</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="Overview_ListContainer__RcPDE "><div class="Overview_highlightHeading__8JSvd">Why consider <span>buying this property</span>?</div><div class="Overview_HighlightsContainer__cYf_c"><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Ultra-luxurious 4 &amp;amp; 5 BHK sea-facing residences.</li><li>Impeccable privacy &amp;amp; discretion in every home.</li><li>Excellent connectivity to South Mumbai &amp;amp; BKC.</li><li>Iconic twin-tower architecture angled for maximum sea views.</li></ul><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Residences managed &amp;amp; serviced by The Ritz-Carlton.</li><li>World-class amenities &amp;amp; concierge services.</li><li>Prime location in Worli, Mumbai&amp;rsquo;s premium neighborhood.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="AIReviewSummary"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Container__cdZ_7 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Header__Z33Z1"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleWrapper__VrIqs"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleRow__RxyFc"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_Title__r4_AU"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">Google AI Summary</div></h2><span class="AIReviewSummary_Sparkle__4AIGg">✦</span></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_AiBadge__yHMUt"></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ContentWrapper__H1KTG" style="max-height:380px"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_SummaryText__LoG_f text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Online reviews for Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli characterize the project as a pinnacle of ultra-luxury living in South Mumbai. Most reviewers emphasize the prestige associated with the Ritz-Carlton branding and the architectural significance of the dual-tower design. While the project receives high praise for its exclusivity and world-class management, some feedback notes the high density of the surrounding Worli area and the extreme entry price point. +1</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Grid__9zT79"><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="up-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The good things</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Brand Association</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The partnership with The Ritz-Carlton provides residents with access to global standards of hospitality and concierge services.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Panoramic Views</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The strategic angling of the towers ensures that almost every residence enjoys unobstructed views of the Arabian Sea and the Bandra-Worli Sea Link.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Spacious Layouts</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The apartments are noted for their massive floor plans, often exceeding 5,000 square feet, which is rare for South Mumbai.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Elite Amenities</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project features a comprehensive suite of luxury facilities including a private spa, salon, home theatre, and extensive sports courts.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Strategic Connectivity</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The location offers swift access to the Bandra-Worli Sea Link, making commutes to North Mumbai and BKC relatively efficient.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">High Security</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The premises are equipped with advanced multi-tier security systems and 24x7 surveillance for resident privacy.</div></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="down-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">Needs improvement</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Traffic Congestion</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The surrounding roads in Worli, particularly near Dr. Annie Besant Road, experience significant bottlenecks during peak commuting hours.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Entry Cost</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The exceptionally high price per square foot makes it accessible only to ultra-high-net-worth individuals, limiting the secondary market liquidity.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Local Density</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Despite the luxury inside the gates, the immediate vicinity is densely populated with commercial and older residential structures.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Ongoing Development</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Some residents and visitors have mentioned occasional noise and dust from neighboring construction projects in the evolving Worli skyline.</div></div></div></div></div><div><hr class="AIReviewSummary_Divider__md7XZ"/><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_VerdictLabel__jEfM0 text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The Verdict</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTags___OivB"><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Symbol of prestige</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Ideal for ultra-high-net-worth individuals</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Excellent for those seeking privacy</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Top-tier hospitality integration</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Best-in-class sea views</div></span></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_FadeOverlay__CFpBd" style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ToggleContainer__OfGS6 "><button class="AIReviewSummary_ViewMoreBtn__LXBrc"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_BtnText__a2mA5 text_mobile-cta__98PCA" data-testid="text-custom">REVEAL FULL SUMMARY</div><span class="AIReviewSummary_BtnIcon__HS5CT">✦</span><div class="AIReviewSummary_Shimmer__D9tsE"></div></button></div></div></section><section id="Amenities"><div class="Amenities_Amenities__Idw7g" data-testid="blox-Amenities"><div class="Amenities_AmmCard__Gu2e5 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="Amenities_AmenitiesHeadingTxt__bxyH0 squarebx rightPos"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm "><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Amenities</div></h2></div><div class="Amenities_amenitiesDesktop__NRcWU"><div class="Amenities_TagGrid__rI9__"><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/Car-Parking-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-secondary.svg"/><div>Car Parking Space</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/gym-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg"/><div>Gymnasium</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/indoor-games-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg"/><div>Indoor Games</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/jogging-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg"/><div>Jogging / Cycle Track</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg"/><div>Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/large-green-area-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" styl